WEBVTT

00:00:27.842 --> 00:00:28.885
{\an8}Happy birthday!

00:00:28.885 --> 00:00:31.385
{\an8}Hey! Cheers! Thank you, guys!

00:00:32.388 --> 00:00:33.478
{\an8}Alright!

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.600
Babe, you’re not drinking.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.267
Come on, drink!

00:00:39.145 --> 00:00:40.725
Go, go, go!

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:50.989
More! More!

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.910
More!

00:00:55.953 --> 00:00:57.453
More, babe! More, babe!

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:01.993
Nice one, babe!

00:01:07.298 --> 00:01:09.338
Let’s do another cheers!

00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:12.345
Cheers!

00:01:14.806 --> 00:01:17.096
Chug! Chug! Chug! Chug!

00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:19.763
I’m done! I’m done—

00:01:43.668 --> 00:01:44.298
Ari?

00:01:46.254 --> 00:01:46.874
Yes?

00:01:54.512 --> 00:01:57.482
Shhh... Keep quiet. You’re Ari, right?

00:01:58.808 --> 00:02:00.308
Sorry—What is it?

00:02:01.519 --> 00:02:02.519
Hi, I’m Janna.

00:02:03.771 --> 00:02:04.771
What do you need?

00:02:05.064 --> 00:02:07.483
Your boyfriend, Tristan,
he’s outside the center.

00:02:07.483 --> 00:02:08.603
He said he wants to see you.

00:02:10.278 --> 00:02:10.858
Huh?

00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:12.617
You’re able to go out?

00:02:12.989 --> 00:02:14.779
Shhh! Don’t be loud!

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.448
I know a way out of here.

00:02:18.953 --> 00:02:20.743
Come with me, he
really wants to see you.

00:02:22.415 --> 00:02:22.915
Ah...

00:02:28.004 --> 00:02:29.874
Isn’t what you’re doing forbidden?

00:02:30.506 --> 00:02:32.546
Duh—Of course it is.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:35.310
But I think I’d go crazy if I stayed here.

00:02:36.095 --> 00:02:37.465
Look, if you don’t want to,

00:02:37.471 --> 00:02:40.061
I’ll just go and tell him
you’re not interested.

00:02:40.391 --> 00:02:41.311
Uh—wait, wait...

00:02:43.102 --> 00:02:44.562
We really won’t get caught?

00:02:45.188 --> 00:02:47.898
Ari, I sneak out every night.

00:02:48.065 --> 00:02:49.485
I’ve never been caught.

00:02:51.944 --> 00:02:53.274
Okay, fine, fine.

00:02:54.405 --> 00:02:56.615
Tonight, okay?
I’ll come back for you.

00:03:20.139 --> 00:03:21.099
Is it still far?

00:03:24.352 --> 00:03:26.442
Janna, are you sure
this is the right way?

00:03:27.438 --> 00:03:28.518
Just follow me.

00:03:32.944 --> 00:03:33.654
Tristan?

00:03:34.946 --> 00:03:35.566
Hi, babe.

00:03:43.579 --> 00:03:44.119
How are you?

00:03:44.997 --> 00:03:45.667
I’m okay...

00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:49.296
I’ll go take a walk for a bit.

00:03:49.543 --> 00:03:50.253
Thanks!

00:03:52.838 --> 00:03:53.508
Babe, let’s sit.

00:03:55.132 --> 00:03:55.472
Come here.

00:04:01.806 --> 00:04:02.346
Hi...

00:04:03.432 --> 00:04:05.482
You really drove all the way here?

00:04:05.935 --> 00:04:07.895
Yeah, is it that hard to believe?

00:04:08.479 --> 00:04:11.439
It’s not that. It’s just... it’s really late.

00:04:12.483 --> 00:04:14.483
Actually, babe, I’ve been here
since this afternoon.

00:04:15.569 --> 00:04:17.619
I saw you there, at the balcony.

00:04:18.948 --> 00:04:20.868
No way. Seriously?

00:04:21.575 --> 00:04:27.205
I just took a chance I might see you,
since I know visitors aren’t allowed.

00:04:28.374 --> 00:04:30.414
Then why are you still here?

00:04:32.044 --> 00:04:33.294
I didn’t want to go home earlier.

00:04:33.296 --> 00:04:36.296
I really felt like I’d see
you and talk to you.

00:04:36.757 --> 00:04:37.927
See? Was I wrong?

00:04:40.845 --> 00:04:42.175
I missed you so much.

00:04:43.055 --> 00:04:44.135
I missed you too, babe.

00:04:44.473 --> 00:04:46.513
It hasn’t even been a week,
but I already miss you so much.

00:04:48.227 --> 00:04:49.147
I love you.

00:04:49.812 --> 00:04:50.902
I love you, too, baby.

00:08:15.768 --> 00:08:17.688
Oh, sorry! I didn’t mean to interrupt,

00:08:18.062 --> 00:08:21.192
but we need to go back.
They’re about to wake up.

00:08:23.609 --> 00:08:24.199
Alright, alright.

00:08:26.028 --> 00:08:27.778
-Let’s see each other again?
-Of course, babe.

00:08:30.241 --> 00:08:31.081
See you soon, okay?

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:33.040
Let’s go.

00:08:38.916 --> 00:08:39.996
Thank you.

00:08:48.467 --> 00:08:51.137
Ari, can I talk to you in my office?

00:08:52.179 --> 00:08:53.099
I’ll wait for you there.

00:09:06.777 --> 00:09:07.907
-How are you—
-Uhm...

00:09:08.571 --> 00:09:09.241
I’m okay.

00:09:13.701 --> 00:09:14.291
That’s good.

00:09:15.536 --> 00:09:15.996
I hope...

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.540
all is really well during
your first week here.

00:09:23.669 --> 00:09:26.469
So, since you arrived here,

00:09:27.506 --> 00:09:31.096
has anything memorable happened?

00:09:32.052 --> 00:09:32.972
Aah...

00:09:35.514 --> 00:09:36.384
Not really.

00:09:37.725 --> 00:09:38.345
Alright...

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:43.647
Maybe you can just tell
me about your day,

00:09:43.647 --> 00:09:46.487
what usually happens, like
from the time you wake up

00:09:46.984 --> 00:09:48.354
until you go to bed. Something like that?

00:09:49.403 --> 00:09:50.103
Aah...

00:09:50.863 --> 00:09:53.193
I’m still adjusting my sleep.

00:09:53.699 --> 00:09:55.829
So sometimes when I
wake up, it feels like

00:09:56.368 --> 00:09:57.788
I didn’t get enough sleep.

00:09:59.455 --> 00:10:01.495
But of course, I still have to get up,

00:10:01.874 --> 00:10:04.624
so after I eat,

00:10:05.961 --> 00:10:07.721
I just hang out outside.

00:10:07.963 --> 00:10:09.583
I look at the trees.

00:10:10.466 --> 00:10:13.846
Next thing I know,
it’s night again. Then...

00:10:15.179 --> 00:10:16.679
I just try to fall asleep.

00:10:18.015 --> 00:10:18.885
Pretty boring, huh?

00:10:20.434 --> 00:10:21.394
Very.

00:10:22.686 --> 00:10:25.436
But you know, that’s totally normal.

00:10:25.939 --> 00:10:28.359
Because you were removed from

00:10:28.901 --> 00:10:31.741
your normal life, or at least the
life you were used to.

00:10:32.196 --> 00:10:33.446
So it’s hard to adjust.

00:10:35.157 --> 00:10:37.327
But it’s part of the process.

00:10:40.037 --> 00:10:43.577
You mentioned having
trouble sleeping,

00:10:44.958 --> 00:10:45.918
is there a reason for that?

00:10:47.378 --> 00:10:48.588
Last night...

00:10:49.546 --> 00:10:50.926
I had a dream.

00:10:52.132 --> 00:10:53.552
Huh? What was it about?

00:10:55.803 --> 00:10:59.803
I saw the things we used to do.

00:11:01.475 --> 00:11:04.605
When I was totally wasted,

00:11:05.354 --> 00:11:11.314
and when my best friend and I used,
along with my boyfriend.

00:11:13.237 --> 00:11:14.197
But you know what,

00:11:14.571 --> 00:11:17.121
I kept saying in my dream

00:11:18.534 --> 00:11:19.494
that I didn’t want it anymore.

00:11:21.495 --> 00:11:23.165
We’ve had many cases like that.

00:11:24.331 --> 00:11:25.841
And... it’s valid.

00:11:27.251 --> 00:11:30.087
What I like about what
you said is that

00:11:30.087 --> 00:11:32.217
you acknowledged you
don’t want it anymore.

00:11:33.173 --> 00:11:35.173
That is two steps going forward.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.180
You are trying to heal

00:11:39.138 --> 00:11:40.808
and it’s clear to you
that you want out.

00:11:42.725 --> 00:11:45.475
I hope this continues, okay?

00:11:46.687 --> 00:11:50.227
You just take your medicines regularly

00:11:50.232 --> 00:11:53.822
and follow the rules here,
for your healing.

00:11:54.903 --> 00:11:59.653
Because when you leave the center
and go back on your own,

00:12:00.576 --> 00:12:01.785
it’s up to you

00:12:01.785 --> 00:12:05.035
whether you continue to live a better life,

00:12:05.456 --> 00:12:09.246
or allow yourself to go back
to your old ways.

00:12:11.086 --> 00:12:11.836
So...

00:12:13.338 --> 00:12:16.428
while you’re here,
I suggest you try to have

00:12:17.801 --> 00:12:19.221
new habits,

00:12:20.429 --> 00:12:21.719
try a new lifestyle,

00:12:22.347 --> 00:12:23.517
make new friends!

00:12:23.932 --> 00:12:24.562
Okay?

00:12:25.976 --> 00:12:26.596
Okay.

00:12:34.443 --> 00:12:35.063
Ari.

00:12:37.613 --> 00:12:40.653
Hey, you've been ignoring
me since last night.

00:12:43.285 --> 00:12:44.115
It’s nothing…

00:12:45.996 --> 00:12:49.586
-I saw you last night--
-Hey! Someone might hear you.

00:12:50.876 --> 00:12:52.836
Do you see something I don’t?

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:57.130
OMG! Is that why you’re here?

00:12:58.217 --> 00:12:58.967
Silly.

00:12:59.384 --> 00:13:00.384
Don’t be shy.

00:13:01.136 --> 00:13:03.556
It’s just me. And that’s normal, okay?

00:13:03.972 --> 00:13:05.312
You missed each other, that’s all.

00:13:05.682 --> 00:13:07.142
So what exactly did you see?

00:13:07.434 --> 00:13:09.224
A full-length movie. That kind.

00:13:11.188 --> 00:13:12.068
Gosh--

00:13:14.274 --> 00:13:15.734
It’s Tristan--

00:13:16.151 --> 00:13:18.201
Just to be clear, I’m not always like that.

00:13:18.862 --> 00:13:20.782
There’s nothing wrong with it.
Come on.

00:13:21.573 --> 00:13:24.533
And you know what?
That was my first time outdoors.

00:13:24.743 --> 00:13:26.493
Oh no, you’re missing out!

00:13:26.912 --> 00:13:30.382
Go on, explore.
Try all sorts of things.

00:13:30.999 --> 00:13:32.169
Try something new.

00:13:33.502 --> 00:13:35.512
But why didn’t you say anything?

00:13:38.257 --> 00:13:39.967
And you won’t get to finish?

00:13:41.677 --> 00:13:42.217
Besides...

00:13:43.428 --> 00:13:45.518
I actually enjoyed watching you.

00:13:46.974 --> 00:13:51.724
Why do you seem so okay with it
like you’re used to seeing that stuff?

00:13:52.062 --> 00:13:53.982
Well, in case you didn’t know,

00:13:54.189 --> 00:13:57.649
that’s the reason my ex-boyfriend
had me admitted here.

00:13:58.193 --> 00:14:00.233
Ex-fiancé, to be exact.

00:14:00.654 --> 00:14:02.574
Huh? Why?

00:14:03.657 --> 00:14:05.447
He said I had a sex addiction.

00:14:05.993 --> 00:14:06.743
“He said,” okay?

00:14:07.703 --> 00:14:10.203
I think he just brought me here

00:14:10.205 --> 00:14:12.455
as a way to get out
of our relationship.

00:14:13.125 --> 00:14:15.375
Maybe he just couldn’t keep up

00:14:15.377 --> 00:14:17.507
with my energy in bed
and everywhere else.

00:14:18.797 --> 00:14:20.427
So I gave it to him.

00:14:20.757 --> 00:14:22.177
I broke up with him.

00:14:22.759 --> 00:14:25.179
After all, he already paid for this rehab.

00:14:26.388 --> 00:14:29.098
So how often did you
ask for it to be called

00:14:29.933 --> 00:14:30.683
an “addict”?

00:14:31.518 --> 00:14:34.938
Hmmm... once, sometimes twice,

00:14:35.606 --> 00:14:36.476
or thrice.

00:14:37.691 --> 00:14:39.281
Isn’t that normal though?

00:14:39.651 --> 00:14:41.821
Three times a day?
That’s “normal”?

00:14:42.487 --> 00:14:45.407
Yes! Especially on
special occasions.

00:14:46.283 --> 00:14:48.403
So, how about you?
Why are you here?

00:14:49.328 --> 00:14:51.038
I’ve seen you around for a week now,

00:14:51.371 --> 00:14:52.581
but you looked kind of grumpy.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.790
Maybe you’re a snob,
so I didn’t bother trying.

00:14:57.377 --> 00:14:59.167
I’m not. But...

00:14:59.671 --> 00:15:02.131
my case is alcohol and drug addiction.

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.720
Oh! So you’re the real addict here.

00:15:09.097 --> 00:15:10.727
See? You’re so grumpy.

00:15:11.224 --> 00:15:12.434
I was only teasing you.

00:15:17.272 --> 00:15:20.402
You know, what we’re going
through is far from ideal,

00:15:20.484 --> 00:15:22.394
so let’s make it fun, right?

00:15:24.613 --> 00:15:25.233
You’re right.

00:15:27.282 --> 00:15:29.242
Same time tonight?

00:15:30.786 --> 00:15:31.406
Sure.

00:15:32.412 --> 00:15:35.042
I have a feeling
Tristan’s coming back.

00:15:36.416 --> 00:15:39.126
For sure! Especially after your
performance last night.

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:49.430
Tan!

00:15:50.764 --> 00:15:52.304
Hey, come out of there.

00:15:52.641 --> 00:15:53.481
Tristan!

00:15:54.017 --> 00:15:56.147
Keep your voice down,
someone might hear us.

00:15:57.479 --> 00:15:58.769
He’s not here.

00:16:01.316 --> 00:16:03.276
This is where I saw him last night.

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.780
He wouldn’t be traveling this late, right?

00:16:09.783 --> 00:16:10.823
Maybe he’s just running late?

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.330
Did he tell you
he was coming today?

00:16:15.664 --> 00:16:19.244
Yeah, he said we’d
see each other again.

00:16:19.793 --> 00:16:22.333
Maybe something came up,
an emergency or something.

00:16:23.547 --> 00:16:26.217
There are still more nights,
more chances.

00:16:28.552 --> 00:16:31.142
Or maybe he already got
what he wanted last night

00:16:32.389 --> 00:16:33.889
and didn’t feel the
need to come back.

00:16:35.475 --> 00:16:37.015
What do you want, anyway?

00:16:37.644 --> 00:16:38.394
Nothing.

00:16:39.438 --> 00:16:41.028
Come on, you wanted
round two, didn’t you?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:42.320
No, I didn’t.

00:16:42.607 --> 00:16:45.527
Come with me. Let’s go somewhere.

00:16:45.736 --> 00:16:48.866
-Where? Where are we going?
-Just come. Just trust me.

00:16:50.157 --> 00:16:53.117
Where are we, Janna?
Feels like we’ve gone far.

00:16:53.326 --> 00:16:56.416
-Isn’t this dangerous? It’s late--
-Come on! Let’s have fun!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.374
--Let’s sit here at the sides.
-Let’s go back--

00:16:59.374 --> 00:17:01.624
-They might be looking for us--
-It’s beautiful here!

00:17:30.363 --> 00:17:32.153
We won’t get caught here, right?

00:17:36.161 --> 00:17:38.961
It really feels better when
you’re not doing this alone.

00:17:39.998 --> 00:17:41.498
‘Cause when I sneak out,

00:17:42.125 --> 00:17:44.455
I feel like I’m going crazy,
doing this all by myself.

00:17:46.963 --> 00:17:48.213
Good thing you’re here.

00:17:49.091 --> 00:17:50.681
Good thing you talked to me.

00:17:53.178 --> 00:17:54.678
Thank you too, Janna.

00:18:12.989 --> 00:18:14.789
You know what I said earlier,

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.250
that you should explore more,

00:18:17.994 --> 00:18:20.034
that you should try new things.

00:22:19.235 --> 00:22:20.445
Janna, come on! Hurry!

00:22:22.697 --> 00:22:24.657
Someone might spot us any moment.

00:22:25.158 --> 00:22:25.988
Wait, wait--

00:22:26.576 --> 00:22:28.906
-Don’t panic...
-It’s just that--

00:22:28.912 --> 00:22:32.172
I always sneak out at
this time of night.

00:22:32.832 --> 00:22:34.882
I’ve never been caught here before.

00:22:35.126 --> 00:22:37.626
-What if we get caught. Come on, hurry!
-It’s okay.

00:22:39.297 --> 00:22:40.177
Ari?

00:22:41.299 --> 00:22:42.389
What happened?

00:22:43.468 --> 00:22:45.508
We just talked yesterday, right?

00:22:47.389 --> 00:22:49.309
Maám, I’m sorry.

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:53.810
Ari, I’m going to put this on record.

00:22:54.562 --> 00:22:55.772
Same with you, Janna.

00:22:56.731 --> 00:22:58.531
And this might affect your stay here.

00:23:00.068 --> 00:23:03.408
We might have to recommend
an extension for both of you.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:08.330
Because you may need additional
sessions and medications.

00:23:08.493 --> 00:23:10.703
Ma’am, please...

00:23:11.204 --> 00:23:12.864
Could you please let it go this time?

00:23:13.665 --> 00:23:16.245
Ma’am, it’s my fault.

00:23:20.713 --> 00:23:24.083
I just pulled Ari with me to go outside.

00:23:25.051 --> 00:23:27.101
I just wanted someone to be with.

00:23:28.096 --> 00:23:30.176
-It’s not her fault.
-Janna...

00:23:32.976 --> 00:23:35.766
Ari, it’s your last week here.

00:23:36.312 --> 00:23:40.532
So I hope you make the
most of it to heal

00:23:40.984 --> 00:23:43.194
and open up to me so I can help you.

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.700
And you, Janna,

00:23:46.281 --> 00:23:48.911
I hope this will be the
last time this happens.

00:23:50.285 --> 00:23:54.075
You need to make time to talk to me
so I can help you.

00:23:54.205 --> 00:23:54.915
You need it.

00:23:55.707 --> 00:23:56.587
I promise.

00:23:59.752 --> 00:24:00.712
Janna,

00:24:01.504 --> 00:24:02.914
why’d you do that?

00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:06.050
Hey, you’re being too serious.

00:24:07.051 --> 00:24:08.011
Come on, it’s nothing.

00:24:08.887 --> 00:24:09.717
It’s fine.

00:24:10.513 --> 00:24:12.343
But what’s going to
happen to you now?

00:24:13.683 --> 00:24:15.593
Ari, what are you even scared of?

00:24:16.102 --> 00:24:17.612
That I might get extended here?

00:24:20.773 --> 00:24:22.023
That’s even better.

00:24:23.401 --> 00:24:26.237
I don’t really have anything
waiting for me outside.

00:24:26.237 --> 00:24:27.817
No one’s out there for me.

00:24:28.781 --> 00:24:32.201
It’s better here. It’s more peaceful.

00:24:33.578 --> 00:24:35.788
And you don’t have to
Think about anything.

00:24:39.042 --> 00:24:39.632
See?

00:24:40.251 --> 00:24:42.091
So don’t worry about it anymore.

00:24:44.214 --> 00:24:45.374
Thank you, Janna.

00:24:48.551 --> 00:24:49.261
Don’t mention it.

00:29:52.480 --> 00:29:54.900
Let’s hear from Ari.

00:30:06.869 --> 00:30:10.498
I slept well last night,
so when I woke up,

00:30:10.498 --> 00:30:13.084
-it felt so good.
-Really refreshed.

00:30:13.084 --> 00:30:14.294
Yes! And...

00:30:15.127 --> 00:30:18.965
I’ve really been savoring
the cold water lately.

00:30:18.965 --> 00:30:21.545
Everything feels like a blessing to me.

00:30:34.689 --> 00:30:36.319
Happy graduation!

00:30:39.735 --> 00:30:41.275
Hey, take care, okay?

00:30:42.196 --> 00:30:43.066
You too.

00:30:44.407 --> 00:30:46.617
Try not to sneak out
too often, alright?

00:30:48.244 --> 00:30:49.204
Yes, ma’am!

00:30:49.745 --> 00:30:50.575
If you say so.

00:30:51.747 --> 00:30:53.037
-I’m going to miss you.
-I’ll wait for you...

00:30:54.166 --> 00:30:55.496
I’ll wait for you out there, okay?

00:30:56.919 --> 00:30:59.129
Of course. I’ll come find you.

00:31:02.049 --> 00:31:03.509
I’m going to miss you.

00:31:04.260 --> 00:31:05.510
I’ll miss you too.

00:31:10.850 --> 00:31:12.100
Knock knock.

00:31:13.436 --> 00:31:14.266
Ready to go, Ari?

00:31:14.687 --> 00:31:15.567
Yes, ma’am.

00:31:19.191 --> 00:31:20.241
Let me help you.

00:31:42.131 --> 00:31:44.181
Ari, sweetheart, come eat now.

00:31:56.604 --> 00:31:59.184
Sorry, I kind of moved
some stuff in your room.

00:31:59.690 --> 00:32:01.820
I cleaned it up while you were gone.

00:32:02.652 --> 00:32:05.202
I also followed the instructions

00:32:05.488 --> 00:32:07.908
to remove everything that could
trigger your relapse.

00:32:08.950 --> 00:32:09.700
Thank you, Ma.

00:32:11.243 --> 00:32:14.453
Ari... I hope you're doing better now.

00:32:16.332 --> 00:32:20.382
I hope you understand why we
brought you there.

00:32:21.963 --> 00:32:23.923
It was for your own good.

00:32:25.299 --> 00:32:27.009
I hope you won’t resent us for it.

00:32:28.928 --> 00:32:29.848
It’s okay, Ma.

00:32:30.888 --> 00:32:32.308
And lastly...

00:32:33.474 --> 00:32:35.934
I know it won't go away just like that,

00:32:35.935 --> 00:32:38.105
because you’ve only been in rehab
for two weeks.

00:32:39.355 --> 00:32:42.315
But please, Ari. Try your best.

00:32:45.069 --> 00:32:45.909
Welcome back.

00:32:48.781 --> 00:32:51.241
-Eat up.
-Your cooking’s really the best, Ma.

00:33:26.360 --> 00:33:27.950
What are you doing here?

00:33:28.738 --> 00:33:29.618
I came to see you.

00:33:31.115 --> 00:33:32.825
How did you know I was back?

00:33:33.242 --> 00:33:36.752
I went to the center. I saw Janna and she said
you were already home.

00:33:38.497 --> 00:33:39.377
Babe...

00:33:41.292 --> 00:33:44.762
You didn’t come see me after the night
we saw each other.

00:33:45.296 --> 00:33:47.926
Baby, I’m sorry. I just had an emergency.

00:33:48.340 --> 00:33:50.550
My car broke down so I couldn’t make it.

00:33:50.926 --> 00:33:53.256
But I still went the next
day just to see you.

00:33:54.972 --> 00:33:55.522
Really?

00:33:55.681 --> 00:33:56.851
Yeah, I promise.

00:33:57.266 --> 00:33:58.766
But then you and Janna weren’t there.

00:33:59.935 --> 00:34:02.855
I was hoping you’d be there
the next night, but no luck.

00:34:04.148 --> 00:34:08.108
-We got caught sneaking out.
-Yeah, Janna told me about that.

00:34:10.821 --> 00:34:13.581
Baby, you know I love you, right?
You know that, right?

00:34:14.241 --> 00:34:16.001
I’d do anything just to see you.

00:34:16.619 --> 00:34:19.919
I’m sorry... I just really missed you.

00:34:20.206 --> 00:34:24.706
Babe, I missed you too. At least now
we can spend more time together.

00:38:56.815 --> 00:38:57.895
I love you.

00:39:05.949 --> 00:39:06.989
-Babe?
-Hmm?

00:39:07.201 --> 00:39:09.291
Portia found out you're back.

00:39:10.037 --> 00:39:12.167
Uh... It’s her birthday tomorrow.

00:39:12.956 --> 00:39:14.126
She said she’s throwing a party.

00:39:14.958 --> 00:39:15.538
Wanna come?

00:39:18.045 --> 00:39:19.045
I don’t feel like going, babe.

00:39:20.297 --> 00:39:23.217
Even just to drop by? Just greet her.

00:39:24.051 --> 00:39:26.511
You know you never missed your
best friend’s birthday.

00:39:26.970 --> 00:39:28.350
So? You okay, babe?

00:39:32.226 --> 00:39:33.806
We’ll just stay for a bit, okay?

00:39:34.895 --> 00:39:38.225
Besides, it’s a chance for me
to make it up to her too.

00:39:39.441 --> 00:39:40.321
Alright.

00:39:48.826 --> 00:39:52.496
Right? And what she said was so funny--

00:39:52.871 --> 00:39:54.790
Right? I told you--

00:39:54.790 --> 00:39:57.170
-What’s up? What’s up? What’s up?
-Hey!

00:39:58.335 --> 00:40:01.375
-Hi, babe!
-Come on. Come on, have some good shit--

00:40:01.713 --> 00:40:03.123
-What’s this?
-Come on, I got you.

00:40:03.132 --> 00:40:05.052
-Babe, I’ll be back.
-No, stay here...

00:40:05.342 --> 00:40:07.222
Babe, just for a bit.
I’ll be right back, I promise.

00:40:08.512 --> 00:40:09.932
Hey, babe...

00:40:10.264 --> 00:40:12.433
How are you? How have you been?

00:40:12.433 --> 00:40:14.593
I’m okay... Happy birthday!

00:40:14.601 --> 00:40:16.228
-What?
-Happy birthday!

00:40:16.228 --> 00:40:19.188
Thank you. Thank you! You know,
I’m so glad you’re here.

00:40:19.189 --> 00:40:21.984
Of course, it’s you!
But I’m only staying a bit, okay?

00:40:21.984 --> 00:40:24.354
-Why?
-It’s just...

00:40:25.070 --> 00:40:27.990
-I just really wanted to drop by.
-Okay. Whatever.

00:40:27.990 --> 00:40:31.830
As long as you’re here, I’m so happy--
I’m so happy, babe!

00:40:32.035 --> 00:40:35.915
Come on, I’ll introduce you to my
other friends. Come on, come here.

00:40:37.082 --> 00:40:39.712
Wait-- let me just grab something quick.

00:40:39.918 --> 00:40:42.878
Take a seat, and I’ll be right there, okay?

00:40:42.880 --> 00:40:44.220
-Okay--
-I’ll see you, babe...

00:40:44.423 --> 00:40:46.133
Thank you-- Thank you!

00:40:51.638 --> 00:40:53.428
Ah, thank you...

00:42:34.408 --> 00:42:35.488
Ma...

00:42:39.204 --> 00:42:41.284
What happened to what we talked about?

00:42:44.293 --> 00:42:49.213
Didn’t I tell you to stop seeing Tristan?

00:42:50.299 --> 00:42:51.969
What else needs to happen to you?

00:42:56.305 --> 00:42:59.805
Ari, please... Stop...

00:43:00.767 --> 00:43:02.517
Help yourself.

00:43:05.897 --> 00:43:06.817
That’s enough too, Ma...

00:43:08.567 --> 00:43:13.157
Just send me back to rehab
so you won’t have to deal with me anymore.

00:43:14.323 --> 00:43:16.193
So I won’t be a burden anymore.

00:43:19.161 --> 00:43:19.961
I’m sorry, Ma...

00:43:21.788 --> 00:43:23.168
I messed up.

00:43:41.558 --> 00:43:44.228
-Babe.
-Hey, babe. What’s wrong? How are you?

00:43:46.813 --> 00:43:49.223
My mom found out what
happened last night.

00:43:49.650 --> 00:43:52.530
I shouldn’t have gone there in the first place.

00:43:53.320 --> 00:43:55.820
Babe, I’m sorry. What happened?

00:43:59.284 --> 00:44:02.404
-I’m going back to the center.
-What? Again?

00:44:03.455 --> 00:44:06.415
I need to take this seriously.
You should too.

00:44:06.875 --> 00:44:08.915
We need to fix this.

00:44:09.336 --> 00:44:11.416
Babe, I don’t understand.

00:44:13.465 --> 00:44:17.675
I was thinking, come with me.
Let’s both check into the center.

00:44:17.678 --> 00:44:18.888
Huh? Why?

00:44:21.264 --> 00:44:24.134
Babe, for this relationship to work,

00:44:24.935 --> 00:44:27.815
we both need to fix ourselves.

00:44:28.522 --> 00:44:32.532
This isn’t just for us. It’s also so you
can be okay with my mom.

00:44:32.818 --> 00:44:34.698
She wants me to break up with you.

00:44:35.404 --> 00:44:38.114
But please, let’s prove her wrong.

00:44:38.615 --> 00:44:39.985
Come with me.

00:44:45.831 --> 00:44:47.081
If you really love me,

00:44:47.833 --> 00:44:49.203
you’ll come with me.

00:45:13.233 --> 00:45:15.943
Babe, can’t we just share a room?

00:45:16.194 --> 00:45:17.604
You’re crazy, babe.

00:45:17.863 --> 00:45:21.573
Of course not.
What matters is we’re here together.

00:45:21.700 --> 00:45:23.700
Thank you for coming with me.

00:45:27.748 --> 00:45:30.958
Ari! OMG, you’re back!

00:45:35.213 --> 00:45:36.213
I missed you.

00:45:36.882 --> 00:45:38.222
I missed you too.

00:45:42.012 --> 00:45:42.892
You too?

00:45:43.680 --> 00:45:45.140
Ari convinced me.

00:45:46.933 --> 00:45:48.303
Why? What happened?

00:45:48.894 --> 00:45:52.773
Aside from missing the calmness

00:45:52.773 --> 00:45:55.023
and the quiet of rehab,

00:45:55.942 --> 00:45:56.862
I had a relapse.

00:45:57.861 --> 00:46:00.121
You left so quickly last time.

00:46:00.530 --> 00:46:02.240
That wouldn’t have helped much.

00:46:02.949 --> 00:46:05.909
Exactly, so here I am again.

00:46:06.411 --> 00:46:07.871
I don’t know how long this time.

00:46:08.580 --> 00:46:10.290
I brought Tristan with me.

00:46:12.501 --> 00:46:13.841
Is he the one who’s a
bad influence on you?

00:46:13.919 --> 00:46:15.129
Hey! It’s not me.

00:46:15.962 --> 00:46:17.632
You know, you’re both the same.

00:46:18.548 --> 00:46:19.968
Both of you love to deny things.

00:46:21.593 --> 00:46:24.133
Since you called me a bad influence...

00:46:24.888 --> 00:46:26.348
I’ll be a bad influence on both of you.

00:46:27.182 --> 00:46:27.682
Huh?

00:46:27.724 --> 00:46:28.514
Let’s sneak out.

00:46:30.519 --> 00:46:32.899
Let’s show Tristan how we do it.

00:46:33.146 --> 00:46:34.896
-Janna.
-I’m in.

00:46:35.357 --> 00:46:37.187
He’s in. Let’s go.

00:46:39.611 --> 00:46:40.951
You know, Ari,

00:46:41.196 --> 00:46:44.406
since there’s nothing you’re
looking forward to after rehab

00:46:45.408 --> 00:46:47.618
and in case your sanction gets extended,

00:46:47.911 --> 00:46:48.911
why not?

00:46:51.790 --> 00:46:53.170
This is the last time.

00:46:54.793 --> 00:46:56.503
I promise, we won’t get caught.

00:46:58.421 --> 00:47:00.931
-Okay, fine.
-Okay.

00:47:07.889 --> 00:47:10.059
You know, I’m really glad you’re here.

00:47:11.059 --> 00:47:12.349
I have someone with me again.

00:47:14.896 --> 00:47:18.236
Of course. But didn’t you say,

00:47:19.025 --> 00:47:20.105
this is the last time?

00:47:20.610 --> 00:47:21.410
Well,

00:47:22.487 --> 00:47:23.817
I don’t have anyone to secretly

00:47:23.822 --> 00:47:25.282
meet outside anymore.

00:47:26.449 --> 00:47:28.579
Tristan’s already here, and so are you.

00:47:28.910 --> 00:47:30.870
You don’t have to sneak out anymore.

00:47:31.705 --> 00:47:34.165
-Nice, right?
-Ugh, here comes the sermon again.

00:47:35.750 --> 00:47:36.840
But you know what,

00:47:37.294 --> 00:47:39.044
when you were gone,
I really struggled.

00:47:39.045 --> 00:47:40.255
Shh, come on.

00:47:41.631 --> 00:47:42.971
You don’t have to think
about that anymore.

00:47:43.049 --> 00:47:43.967
I’m here now.

00:47:43.967 --> 00:47:44.926
And it’s not just me--

00:47:44.926 --> 00:47:45.844
Tristan’s here too.

00:47:45.844 --> 00:47:47.174
See? We gained one more.

00:51:27.357 --> 00:51:30.357
I’m glad you chose to come back
after what happened.

00:51:31.069 --> 00:51:32.069
It’s for the better.

00:51:33.488 --> 00:51:35.738
Good thing you brought Tristan too.

00:51:37.534 --> 00:51:40.154
I knew he needed help too.

00:51:40.495 --> 00:51:42.955
Thank you for convincing him.

00:51:43.123 --> 00:51:46.833
I hope you can
convince Janna too.

00:51:48.002 --> 00:51:49.632
She still won’t talk?

00:51:50.213 --> 00:51:50.963
Not yet.

00:51:51.506 --> 00:51:52.126
But maybe you...

00:51:52.507 --> 00:51:55.137
Maybe you can convince her
so we can help her.

00:52:02.433 --> 00:52:02.973
Babe,

00:52:03.977 --> 00:52:05.267
have you seen Janna?

00:52:05.979 --> 00:52:07.479
No. She’s been gone for a while.

00:52:15.697 --> 00:52:16.367
Janna!

00:52:42.891 --> 00:52:43.521
Janna!

00:52:44.767 --> 00:52:45.397
Babe.

00:52:46.394 --> 00:52:47.854
What happened?

00:52:50.982 --> 00:52:53.742
I went to the clinic earlier.

00:52:57.906 --> 00:52:59.616
Huh? How--

00:53:04.287 --> 00:53:06.367
Because if it’s from the other night--

00:53:06.706 --> 00:53:08.076
it wouldn’t show up this fast.

00:53:09.709 --> 00:53:12.839
Did you sleep with someone else
before we came here?

00:53:15.381 --> 00:53:16.011
Hey!

00:53:18.593 --> 00:53:19.633
Hey, what’s happening?

00:53:21.763 --> 00:53:23.343
Tristan, do you know anything about this?

00:53:34.984 --> 00:53:36.444
You two saw each other--

00:53:37.779 --> 00:53:38.909
while I was gone?

00:53:40.281 --> 00:53:43.251
Don’t tell me something happened
between you two?

00:53:50.541 --> 00:53:51.711
Sorry, Ari.

00:53:52.210 --> 00:53:53.336
It’s my fault.

00:53:53.336 --> 00:53:55.416
-What the hell, Janna!
-Please, stop.

00:53:57.465 --> 00:54:00.005
Why Tristan too? Why?

00:54:00.760 --> 00:54:02.887
Please stop. I’m sorry.

00:54:02.887 --> 00:54:04.977
Sorry? Sorry?

00:54:06.182 --> 00:54:07.022
Well guess what?

00:54:07.308 --> 00:54:09.228
Something happened between me
and Janna too.

00:54:12.230 --> 00:54:15.316
So that’s why the other night
you were enjoying it so much.

00:54:15.316 --> 00:54:17.236
When she kissed you,
you didn’t even flinch.

00:54:19.362 --> 00:54:21.572
Well, shit. Look what happened.

00:54:22.991 --> 00:54:24.541
You got her pregnant.

00:54:31.582 --> 00:54:32.672
And you...

00:54:33.293 --> 00:54:34.793
Babe, stop, please.

00:54:35.086 --> 00:54:37.756
You-- I trusted you.

00:54:38.381 --> 00:54:39.761
You were my friend.

00:54:39.966 --> 00:54:41.426
Why did it have to be us?

00:54:42.176 --> 00:54:43.806
We let you fool us.

00:54:45.471 --> 00:54:46.271
You know what?

00:54:47.056 --> 00:54:48.886
Your ex was right.

00:54:49.392 --> 00:54:51.102
You need help,

00:54:51.352 --> 00:54:54.152
instead of treating this place
as a vacation stay.

00:54:54.897 --> 00:54:56.357
What are you going to do now?

00:54:56.566 --> 00:54:57.646
What’s your plan?

00:55:00.028 --> 00:55:00.858
Let go of me.

00:55:09.078 --> 00:55:10.918
Janna!

00:55:12.081 --> 00:55:13.041
Tristan...

00:55:14.125 --> 00:55:15.165
He ran away.

00:55:15.168 --> 00:55:16.878
Took all his stuff with him.

00:55:18.796 --> 00:55:21.626
What an asshole. All he knows
is how to enjoy life.

00:55:22.633 --> 00:55:24.253
That coward.

00:55:25.219 --> 00:55:27.349
I should’ve just listened to my mom.

00:55:29.599 --> 00:55:30.479
This is my fault.

00:55:31.851 --> 00:55:33.101
If it weren’t for me

00:55:33.102 --> 00:55:34.482
you two wouldn’t have met.

00:55:35.980 --> 00:55:37.940
Then none of this would’ve happened.

00:55:39.359 --> 00:55:42.489
Come on, Ari. It’s not your fault.

00:55:42.779 --> 00:55:43.909
This was my choice.

00:55:45.073 --> 00:55:46.443
I’ll fix this.

00:55:49.327 --> 00:55:50.497
Finally!

00:55:51.537 --> 00:55:54.287
So, what do you want to talk about?

00:55:56.501 --> 00:55:57.421
I’m an addict.

00:55:58.169 --> 00:55:59.589
I’m addicted to sex.

00:56:01.631 --> 00:56:03.971
Thank you for
acknowledging that, Janna.

00:56:04.759 --> 00:56:06.509
May I ask you something?

00:56:06.761 --> 00:56:10.931
What do you feel
when you have sex?

00:56:11.933 --> 00:56:13.133
It feels good.

00:56:14.644 --> 00:56:17.184
You keep craving that feeling.

00:56:18.564 --> 00:56:20.644
But on a deeper level...

00:56:21.859 --> 00:56:26.409
Why do you think that is?
What does it give you?

00:56:28.074 --> 00:56:31.194
Maybe that’s the only time
I feel like I’m not alone.

00:56:34.122 --> 00:56:35.462
Because I grew up on my own.

00:56:36.624 --> 00:56:38.284
Ever since I discovered sex,

00:56:38.751 --> 00:56:41.631
it’s like that’s when I finally felt
a real connection.

00:56:42.797 --> 00:56:45.677
Like there were people out there for me.

00:56:47.427 --> 00:56:48.847
So I kept looking for it.

00:56:51.055 --> 00:56:53.685
Because I don’t want to
feel alone anymore.

00:56:54.434 --> 00:56:56.934
I heard you’re having a baby, Janna?

00:57:00.898 --> 00:57:02.818
Yes, well...

00:57:03.818 --> 00:57:04.778
It was unexpected…

00:57:07.029 --> 00:57:08.159
I had sex.

00:57:10.199 --> 00:57:13.579
Janna, your life is different now.

00:57:14.203 --> 00:57:15.613
You now have someone--

00:57:16.205 --> 00:57:17.955
someone to be with.

00:57:19.792 --> 00:57:22.842
I hope you find new priorities
in your life,

00:57:23.796 --> 00:57:26.376
or a new purpose.

00:57:28.301 --> 00:57:32.891
I know it’s not just yourself
you’ll be thinking of anymore.

00:57:33.598 --> 00:57:35.688
You have to know your priorities.

00:57:37.101 --> 00:57:41.355
I suggest you slowly shift your focus
on the baby

00:57:41.355 --> 00:57:44.735
and make sure you take care
of him or her.

00:57:45.902 --> 00:57:47.742
This is only the beginning, Janna.

00:57:48.613 --> 00:57:50.983
I know you’ll get better.